################################################################################
# users.properties — TEMPLATE ONLY. The real file is NOT in this repository.
#
# This file defines Karaf's JAAS realm, which guards:
#   - the SSH console          (8101)
#   - JMX / RMI                (1099, 44444)
#   - the HTTP Basic realm in front of the Felix web console and Hawtio (8181)
#
# It used to ship here with a default password. That meant rotating the
# credential took a commit, and the old value stayed in the history of a
# public repository. It is now GENERATED AT CONTAINER START by
# containers/fzl-karaf-camel-integration/entrypoint.sh from:
#
#   FZL_KARAF_USER=...
#   FZL_KARAF_PASSWORD=...
#
# in .env (gitignored — see .env.template). nginx reads the same two variables
# to build the Authorization header it presents towards /system/console and
# /hawtio, so the two sides can never drift apart.
#
# To rotate the password:
#   1. openssl rand -base64 24        # or any strong value
#   2. put it in FZL_KARAF_PASSWORD in .env
#   3. docker compose up -d --force-recreate fzl-karaf-camel-integration fzl-nginx
#
# The generated file looks like this (roles unchanged from Karaf's default
# admingroup — edit entrypoint.sh if you need to narrow them):
#
#   <FZL_KARAF_USER> = <FZL_KARAF_PASSWORD>,_g_:admingroup
#   _g_\:admingroup = group,admin,manager,viewer,systembundles,ssh
################################################################################
